# deploy/secrets/onboard_admin_token.example
#
# EXAMPLE ONLY — NOT A SECRET. Replace the value with a random operator token
# before first boot, for example:
#
#   head -c 32 /dev/urandom | base64 > deploy/secrets/onboard_admin_token
#   chmod 600 deploy/secrets/onboard_admin_token
#
# Without this file every authenticated endpoint returns 401 by design (the
# console is locked). This token is the single-operator admin credential; do not
# reuse it for any provider and never commit the real file.
REPLACE_ME_WITH_A_RANDOM_OPERATOR_TOKEN
